window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Nyro was wrong about Bianca.</b></p> <p>He wanted to ask for forgiveness and explain everything, but what he discovers about the woman he loves tears him to pieces.</p> <p>Now, he has no choice but to fight against her, even if it means joining the Black King.</p> <p><b>Immerse yourself in Vampire Court, an addicting fantasy series by </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> best-selling author Ingrid Seymour.</b></p>"; 
